  "SubGoals": [],
  "Description": "The ModifyFiles goal is designed to read an HTML file from a specified path, incorporate a header and footer from separate HTML files, and then output the modified HTML file to a designated output location. It requires the full path of the HTML file to be modified, and it reads the contents of 'header.html' and 'footer.html' to insert them into the main HTML file at designated placeholders. The final output is saved with the same name as the original file in an 'output' directory, and a confirmation message is displayed upon completion.",
